      <VERS vnumber="1"> A <gr str="7892">Song </gr>of <gr str="4609">degrees </gr>of <gr str="1732">David</gr>. I was <gr str="8055">glad </gr>when they <gr str="559">said </gr>unto me, Let us <gr str="1980">go </gr>into the <gr str="1004">house </gr>of the <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>. </VERS>
